    <briefdescription>
<para>Defines the boundaries of the game world and provides clamping. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classGameWorld" kindref="compound">GameWorld</ref> class holds the minimum and maximum coordinates of the world in both X and Y axes. It provides a ClampPosition method to keep entities within these bounds and renders the world borders. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
